comments.body:
If the wallet broadcast is disabled (`-walletbroadcast=0`), then the "is not eligible to be rebroadcast" will be misleading because it implies that there is something specific about this transaction that makes it not eligible.

Consider extending `TransactionCanBeBroadcast()` to return the reason why the transaction can not be broadcast:

<details>
<summary>[patch] TransactionCanBeBroadcast() with a reason</summary>

```diff
